WEBVTT

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:05.580
I wonder what it will be?

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.540
This week, it's this!

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.810
Black Rose Dragon?

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:15.000
When it's successfully Synchro Summoned, 
it destroys all cards on the field.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.110
Level 3 Twilight Rose Knight tunes two Level 
1 Evil Thorns and Level 2 Dark Verger.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:31.250
The cold flame envelops the entire 
world.  Black flower, bloom!

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.150
Synchro Summon!

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:36.720
Appear, Black Rose Dragon!

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:42.240
Then I activate the Equip 
Spell Thorn of Malice!

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:47.630
The equipped monster gains 600 attack points!

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.370
Aki…

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:59.380
Papa, your eyes are the same as before.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:02.180
Those eyes look like they're 
staring at a monster!

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:03.650
Izayoi!

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.260
I'll make you feel the 
same pain I felt, Yusei.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:16.000
If I no longer have the home that Divine gave 
me, then I'll destroy all the homes in the world!

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:33.660
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:38.760
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:43.670
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:48.440
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:53.800
No matter how bad today is

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.790
There’s still the faintest light

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:04.190
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:08.250
Is light it myself

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:13.260
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:18.230
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:24.530
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:28.510
Today will never exist again

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:34.410
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:04.230
Hate From Sorrow!Withstand 
It, Stardust Dragon

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:09.640
Aki…

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.090
Black Rose Dragon's effect activates!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:22.090
By removing Evil Thorn in 
my graveyard from play,

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:25.640
Shield Warrior switches to attack position, 
and its attack points become 0.

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:29.660
Black Rose Gale!

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:39.630
Black Rose Dragon attacks Shield Warrior!

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:41.430
Hate Rose Whip!

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.980
I open the trap card Realize Defense!

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:50.740
When a monster with more defense points 
than attack points is in attack position,

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:52.840
I can switch that monster 
to defense position!

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:56.890
Keep going, Black Rose Dragon!

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:06.260
Due to the effect of your equip spell, 
you can't destroy a monster in battle.

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:09.060
But if the equipped monster's 
attack points are greater

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:13.440
than your monster's defense points, then you 
lose life points equal to the difference!

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:20.450
Yusei!

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:24.550
When my monster equipped with Thorn 
of Malice attacks your monster,

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:28.920
your monster loses 600 attack and defense 
points after damage calculation.

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:32.890
Oh no!  Due to Thorn of Malice's effect,

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:37.000
his monster isn't destroyed, and 
it loses attack and defense points.

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.560
I end my turn.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:43.000
I won't defeat you quickly.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.140
I'll make you feel more pain.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.140
Izayoi…

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:54.820
This is a detestable mark.

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:57.550
I don't care about Signers!

00:04:58.050 --> 00:04:59.880
Yusei Fudo.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:03.120
You can't save me either.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:09.550
The only person in this world 
who accepted me was Divine.

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:12.840
He was the only one who gave me a home.

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:16.700
Not you, Papa!  Nor you!

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:18.380
And Divine was…

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:26.650
Divine!

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:30.820
I no longer have a home in the entire world.

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:34.470
I'll make you face the same fate!

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:36.640
Izayoi, don't you understand?

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:39.960
You've had a home from the very beginning!

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:42.150
Yusei…

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:43.800
No, there isn't.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:49.970
When Divine died, this world 
changed into a detestable world.

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:51.090
That's why…

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:55.650
I will destroy this world!

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:02.020
Aki…

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:09.130
This is bad.  Izayoi's hatred 
is increasing her power.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:17.740
My turn!

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:24.280
I open my trap card Reinforce Truth!

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:27.690
By not battling this turn, I 
can Special Summon one monster

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:30.690
with 1000-or-fewer attack 
points from my deck!

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:32.810
Come, Speed Warrior!

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:39.890
Then I summon the Tuner 
Monster Junk Synchron!

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:45.680
Three monsters…  The total Level is 8…

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:47.160
It's coming!

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:53.580
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes Level 3 Shield 
Warrior and Level 2 Speed Warrior.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:07:01.080
The wishes come together to form a new 
shining star!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:02.980
Synchro Summon!

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:06.150
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:16.390
But Black Rose Dragon has 
greater attack points.

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:22.600
Stardust Dragon is protecting us?

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:26.730
I end my turn.

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:31.340
You're protecting your 
friends?  What a farce.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.960
You're all talk.

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:36.280
You can't save anyone!

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:41.280
That may be true, but I'll still try.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:43.550
My turn.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:48.790
Go, Black Rose Dragon!  
Slice Stardust Dragon!

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:50.460
Hate Rose Whip!

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:02.400
Due to Thorn of Malice, it's not destroyed.

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:08.170
Stardust Dragon will feel pain on its 
skin, flesh and bones for eternity!

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:17.210
Stardust Dragon!

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:21.140
Aki, stop!

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.710
Stop it!

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:26.130
I end my turn.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.690
My turn!

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:32.330
From my hand, I activate the 
Quick-Play Spell Half Shut!

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:36.340
This card halves the attack 
points of one monster.

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:40.100
Then that monster cannot be 
destroyed in battle this turn.

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:42.610
I select Black Rose Dragon as the target!

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:50.050
Stardust Dragon's attack points are 
greater than Black Rose Dragon's!

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:53.290
Is Yusei going to attack?

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:58.570
Izayoi, Stardust will strike you 
from its soul to wake you up!

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:02.060
Stardust Dragon attacks Black Rose Dragon!

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.700
Shooting Sonic!

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:13.510
However, Black Rose Dragon 
cannot be destroyed.

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:16.360
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:21.330
During this End Phase, Black Rose 
Dragon's attack points return to normal.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.050
My turn!

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:29.200
Black Rose Dragon attacks Stardust Dragon!

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.990
Hate Rose Whip!

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:44.990
Due to Thorn of Malice's effect, Stardust Dragon isn't 
destroyed, but it loses an additional 600 attack points.

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.210
This monster…

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:54.880
Yusei is trying to protect us.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:58.550
Despite being wounded, he's 
still trying to face Aki.

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:01.820
But I'm scared…

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:10.480
No matter how much I try to smoothing 
things over, I can't avoid reality.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:15.100
That's why I closed the door to my feelings.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:19.110
Even though my true feelings 
were behind that door...

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:24.550
I set one card and end my turn.

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:26.280
My turn!

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:28.530
I didn't get it.

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:32.520
If I get that card, I can use this.

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:34.990
I set one card.

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:36.860
I end my turn.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:39.860
You've finally run out of things to do.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:43.550
I know that this is how you really are.

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:48.730
You can't save anyone!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.670
You're right!  I don't have the power!

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:56.550
I can't save anyone.

00:10:56.550 --> 00:11:02.350
However, I can't abandon 
a friend who's in pain!

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.030
Friend?

00:11:09.090 --> 00:11:13.640
All I can do is hope that 
my friend will be saved.

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:17.600
You're saying that you won't do anything!

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:22.770
Divine embraced me!  He made me feel safe!

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:24.740
He gave me a home!

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:26.480
My turn!

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:31.410
Battle!  Black Rose Dragon 
attacks Stardust Dragon!

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:33.150
Hate Rose Whip!

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:41.020
Divine accepted my power!

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:47.090
No matter how hard life became, he 
gave me a home that I could return to!

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:12.580
Stop it, Aki!  Stop hurting people!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:13.700
Watch out!

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:17.690
I open my trap card Defense Draw!

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:20.980
Damage from this battle becomes 0!

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:30.410
Then I draw one card from my deck.

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:36.380
Sorry, Aki.  It's my fault.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:39.110
Stop it!  It doesn't matter what you say now!

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:42.780
I was afraid of your power.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:44.590
I was afraid of you.

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:49.770
I'm not tricking you.  I'm being honest.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:52.510
I was scared of you.

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:54.400
I knew that.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:59.370
That's why you threw me away!  
Because I'm a monster!

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:04.580
It's true that I stopped thinking 
after what I said to you.

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:06.720
However, I was wrong.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:10.810
I should have realized that 
I had feelings beyond that.

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:15.210
I…  We love you.

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:18.000
You expect me to believe that?

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:20.690
I'm not asking you to believe me.

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:24.960
In fact, the person who was 
supposed to believe was me.

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:27.400
To believe that I love you.

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:32.620
Be quiet!  I'll never believe that!

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:33.900
Izayoi!

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:41.280
Due to Thorn of Malice's effect, Stardust 
Dragon loses an additional 600 attack points!

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:48.080
I activate the spell card 
Wonder Clover from my hand!

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:52.180
By sending one Level 4 monster 
in my hand to the graveyard,

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.790
one of my monsters can attack twice!

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.400
Please stop, Aki!

00:13:57.400 --> 00:14:02.000
Black Rose Dragon, attack 
Stardust Dragon again!

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:05.270
Crush Papa this time!

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:10.370
Stardust Dragon has 700 attack points.

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:14.840
I open my trap card Iron Resolve!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:18.880
By halving my life points, 
battle damage becomes 0!

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:19.940
What?

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:23.400
But Stardust Dragon's attack points become…

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:29.110
100 attack points…

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:35.300
I open my Continuous Trap 
Doom Petal Countdown!

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:40.340
At the End Phase of my turn, by 
removing one Plant-Type monster

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:44.340
in my graveyard from play, you 
take 300 points of damage.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:48.410
Please stay back!

00:14:54.580 --> 00:15:01.570
By removing one Plant-Type monster from play 
on the next turn, Yusei's life points become 0.

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:03.930
I end my turn.

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:10.740
Her turn is over, but Izayoi's 
power isn't stopping.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:19.700
Can it be that she can't control her power?

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.110
Aki…

00:15:25.140 --> 00:15:26.020
Dear…

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:34.930
Aki, come back to us...

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:38.200
Don't come any closer!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.620
Stop!  It's too dangerous to step any closer!

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:41.950
It's fine!

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:49.840
I've decided that no matter how much 
Aki hurts me, I won't abandon her.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:52.020
I'll listen to what Aki has to say.

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:55.050
I don't believe you!

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:56.010
Aki!

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:00.320
It's right in front of you!

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:05.100
The eyes that will look at you, the ears 
that will listen to your tales of sadness…

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:10.180
Your father and mother are your home!

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:11.910
In front of me...

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:20.540
No!

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:26.320
Then I'll destroy your shell 
built of incorrect hatred!

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:27.650
My turn!

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:29.640
Here it is!

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:33.480
I equip the Equip Spell Silver 
Wing on Stardust Dragon!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:39.920
Then I activate the spell 
card Release Restraint Wave!

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:42.080
That card is…

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:51.280
By destroying one Equip Spell on my field, all 
spell and trap cards on your field are destroyed!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:58.110
Thorn of Malice!

00:16:58.420 --> 00:17:02.520
The spell Thorn of Malice, which is equipped 
to Black Rose Dragon, is destroyed.

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:07.680
Therefore, Black Rose Dragon's attack points and 
Stardust Dragon's attack points return to normal!

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.280
No way!

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:12.730
Stardust Dragon attacks Black Rose Dragon!

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:14.430
Shooting Sonic!

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:28.420
I activate Hedge Guard's effect from my hand!

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:34.450
By sending this card to the graveyard, one 
monster on my field isn't destroyed in battle!

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:44.340
Aki…

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:49.890
The attack points of the 
selected monster are halved!

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:54.100
Aki…

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:56.350
Papa...

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:02.810
My powers won't obey me.

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:07.330
Stop it!  I don't want to hurt my Papa!

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:09.940
Papa!

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:26.260
It's the first time I was 
able to control my power.

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:28.090
Aki…

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:35.270
Papa!

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.400
Aki…

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:51.490
Yusei, please finish this.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:53.990
Finish this battle.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:58.350
I open my trap card Synchro Ring!

00:18:58.350 --> 00:19:03.170
If a Synchro Monster was unable 
to destroy your monster in battle,

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:08.370
that Synchro Monster's attack points 
are doubled, and it can attack again!

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:19.690
Now destroy the witch's curse!

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:23.330
Stardust Dragon attacks Black Rose Dragon!

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:24.820
Shooting Sonic!

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:56.850
Papa...

00:19:57.620 --> 00:19:59.380
I'm sorry.

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:08.580
No matter how afraid I was of your power, 
I should have embraced you like this.

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:11.050
Because I love you.

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:15.330
I also love you!

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:22.320
But is everything fine?  
I hurt you so much, Papa.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:30.590
Aki, your father says that he accepts you.

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:33.410
You have a home if you want it.

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:37.020
You have to think for yourself 
and make a decision.

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:45.000
My place… is here.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:47.700
Aki…

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:51.440
Aki!

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:56.540
I knew that mark was a bond between friends!

00:20:56.870 --> 00:20:58.480
Even though I don't have one...

00:21:01.850 --> 00:21:07.440
This mark brings people together, 
and they become friends.

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.590
It's not a detestable mark.

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:21.980
But I had a friend that I used to believe in.

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:28.330
Those feelings are still inside my heart.

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:32.400
I had a friend like that too.

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:36.730
But we now have different views, 
and it tears away at my heart.

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:44.630
I don't know where these feelings will lead.

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:51.670
But since we were friends in the past, I'll 
carry that burden and keep moving forward.

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:54.300
Yusei…

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:18.300
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:23.370
We will build our own future

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:28.810
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:33.990
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:39.590 --> 00:22:49.130
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:49.570 --> 00:22:54.710
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:59.410
Even if it loses its light

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:04.680
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:23:04.680 --> 00:23:09.150
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:14.740
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:23:14.860 --> 00:23:19.540
This journey has no end

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:25.070
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:30.310
Hear my voice
